# Change summary format

After completing any code, config, or product change in this project, end your reply with this GitHub-style block:

**Summary**
Short title

Description (~25 words) of the user-facing outcome.

Example:
**Summary**
Fill entire week with meals

Whole-week planning now fetches a bigger recipe catalog and fills every weekday slot, backfilling gaps when needed.

Rules:
- Bold label must be exactly **Summary**
- Next line: short title (like a PR/commit title)
- Then a blank line
- Then a ~25-word description (not a file list)
- Skip only for pure Q&A with no changes made
